        <mxCell id="r_01_prompt_txt" value="• 하얀 새·고글·스카프 1:1 비율&lt;br/&gt;• 3D 무광 소프비 8포즈 (16:9)&lt;br/&gt;• 둥근 점눈(● ●)·순백(#FFFFFF) 양볼&lt;br/&gt;• 2D 윤곽선·패치·문자 0%" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=19;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="r_01_prompt">
